<title>USA: Amalgamated Explorations acquires leases.</title>
<headline>Amalgamated Explorations acquires leases.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amalgamated Explorations Inc said Friday it has completed the acquisition new oil and gas leases totaling 9,600 acres.</p>
<p>It said 5,000 acres flank the Teapot Dome of Natrona County, Wyo. A U.S. Navy petroleum reserve, Teapot Dome has been productive for more than 60 years.</p>
<p>An additional 600 acres were added to the company's position on Boone Dome, also located in Natrona County.</p>
<p>Finally, 4,000 acres in a Montana &quot;wildcat&quot; project are now part of Amalgamated holdings, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
